"""Track outline images for the Indy Car app, bundled locally.

Each value is a base64-encoded PNG of a track/circuit outline (white on black),
pre-sized to fill the app's track panel: TRACK_1X entries are 24x26 (1x /
64x32) and TRACK_2X entries are 48x55 (2x / 128x64). Source outlines are the
official circuit diagrams from indycar.com (the TrackOutlines media library),
recolored white on black and downscaled for the LED matrix.
"""

